  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Programme Framework for Lebanon 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project purpose is to develop Lebanon#s Country Program Framework (CPF) covering the period  2025-2028 as a response to the Minister#s request to UNIDO DG seeking UNIDO&apos;s assistance in addressing its industrial development challenges. In this regard, in response to the priorities expressed by the Ministry of Industry, the CPF will provide technical support to the country in order to develop priority industrial subsectors including textile/garments, shoes, furniture/wood, renewable energy, information and communication technologies as well as recycling industries. The CPF will also work on supporting start-ups, industrial statistics and policy, and investment and technology cooperation, while extending support to on-going initiatives tackling industrial resource efficiency, circular economy, and agri-food value chains.  The CP will continue to support the country in its recovery efforts, and contribute to Lebanon industry objectives to increase national industrial competitiveness with increased industrial output and industrial exports, while promoting their transition to greener and circular models.  The CP will be aligned with strategic priorities of Lebanon#s UN Sustainable Development Cooperation Framework (UNSDCF), Lebanon#s I ndustrial Vision 2025, as well as respond to the priorities defined by the Leb</narrative>
  </description>
